                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>We were not able to discover a definitive trend over time, but found a volatile gaming market. That changed trends rapidly without much warning and favor to publishers. Nintendo got lucky and had it&apos;s success streak for a while until more recent times.</run>
